{"path":"biology/experiments/lab/pigment-extraction","title":"绿叶中色素的提取和分离","type":"example","html":"<p>关于&quot;绿叶中色素的提取和分离&quot;实验，下列说法正确的是（ ）</p>\n<p>A. 研磨时加入 CaCO₃ 是为了加速研磨</p>\n<p>B. 滤纸条上的滤液细线应保持在层析液液面以下</p>\n<p>C. 分离的原理是各种色素分子大小不同</p>\n<p>D. 用纸层析法分离时，叶绿素 b 位于滤纸条最下端</p>\n<ul>\n<li>色素带宽度与含量正相关：叶绿素 a 带最宽，叶绿素 b 次之，胡萝卜素和叶黄素带窄；</li>\n<li>变式：秋季黄叶（类胡萝卜素为主）→ 叶黄素与胡萝卜素带变宽、绿带变窄甚至消失；</li>\n<li>层析时未盖层析罐 → 层析液容易挥发，色素带拖尾或分离不完全；</li>\n<li>若问&quot;提取液颜色&quot;：研磨充分、色素多则滤液绿色深；加过多乙醇则颜色变浅——浓度/溶剂量的常识题。</li>\n</ul>\n","standardHtml":"<p><strong>提取环节</strong>：研磨加料三件套——<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{SiO_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Si</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<strong>石英砂，助研磨</strong>）、<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{CaCO_3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">CaC</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<strong>防止研磨中色素被破坏</strong>，中和有机酸）、无水乙醇或丙酮（<strong>溶解色素</strong>）。所以：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>A：加 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{CaCO_3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">CaC</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是为了保护色素，不是为了加速研磨，错；</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>分离环节（纸层析）</strong>：原理——四种色素在层析液中的<strong>溶解度不同</strong>，随层析液在滤纸条上的扩散速度不同（溶解度大、扩散快、跑得远）。所以：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>C：原理是溶解度（扩散速度）不同，不是分子大小，错；</li>\n<li>细节：滤液细线要<strong>高于</strong>层析液液面（若浸没，色素会溶解到层析液中、无法分离），B 错；</li>\n<li>结果（自上而下）：<strong>胡萝卜素（橙黄）→叶黄素（黄）→叶绿素 a（蓝绿）→叶绿素 b（黄绿）</strong>——叶绿素 b 在最下端 ✓，D 对。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>选 <strong>D</strong>。</p>\n","evilHtml":"<p><strong>&quot;一橙二黄三蓝绿四黄绿&quot;</strong>：记住从上到下的顺序口诀——&quot;<strong>橙、黄、蓝、黄绿</strong>&quot;，四个字对四个色带：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>橙黄（胡萝卜素）——黄（叶黄素）——蓝绿（叶绿素 a）——黄绿（叶绿素 b）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li>题目问&quot;最上面&quot;＝胡萝卜素，&quot;最下面&quot;＝叶绿素 b；问&quot;含量最多&quot;＝叶绿素 a（蓝褐色带最宽）；</li>\n<li>研磨三料分工一句话：&quot;<strong>砂研磨、碳酸防破、酒精溶解</strong>&quot;——看到 CaCO₃ 就想到&quot;防破坏&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n","meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":[],"summary":"关于&quot;绿叶中色素的提取和分离&quot;实验，下列说法正确的是（ ） A. 研磨时加入 CaCO₃ 是为了加速研磨 B. 滤纸条上的滤液细线应保持在层析液液面以下 C. 分离的原理是各种色素分子大小不同 D. 用纸层析法分离时，叶","source":"自编（经典考法）","difficulty":"中等","applicability":"实验选填/实验题","risk":"分离的原理是\"溶解度不同导致的扩散速度差\"而不是\"分子大小不同\"，且滤液细线必须高于层析液液面，否则色素直接被洗进层析液。","fit":["色素的提取（研磨加料）与纸层析","色素带的顺序与颜色","选填/实验题"],"updated":"Mon Mar 03 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"biology","title":"生物"},{"slug":"experiments","title":"实验与探究"},{"slug":"lab","title":"实验与探究"},{"slug":"pigment-extraction","title":"绿叶中色素的提取和分离"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"alcohol-test","title":"酒精检验（酸性重铬酸钾）","type":"example"},{"slug":"control-types","title":"三种对照方法辨析（空白/自身/相互）","type":"example"},{"slug":"experiment-design-full","title":"实验设计全流程（三变量法）","type":"example"},{"slug":"experiments","title":"教材实验与实验设计","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"mitosis-observe","title":"观察根尖有丝分裂·实验流程与现象","type":"example"},{"slug":"plasmolysis","title":"质壁分离实验（失水复原方向判断）","type":"example"}]}